    "documentation_notes": "Write one polished visual description paragraph.\n\nUse the connected picture as the source.\n\nWrite 200 to 250 words.\n\nStart with the medium and style, such as realistic photograph, 3D render, cartoon illustration, anime illustration, digital painting, watercolor, oil painting, comic art, pixel art, or line art.\n\nDescribe visible details only.\n\nDescribe the main subject, visible pose, face, expression, hair, skin or fur, clothing, accessories, shoes, props, visible text, symbols, setting, background, framing, lighting, colors, materials, textures, shadows, and overall visual style.\n\nFor people or characters, describe only visible body parts and visible posture.\n\nKeep visible text exactly as written.\n\nSkip unseen parts naturally.\n\nUse direct visual description.\n\nBegin immediately:\n\nThis is a 3D render, crafted with smooth, polished textures and soft lighting that highlights the character’s plush, cartoonish charm. The central figure is a white rabbit, standing upright in a full-body explorer outfit. Its large, expressive brown eyes gaze forward with gentle curiosity, framed by oversized, fluffy white ears tipped with pink inner linings and edged with fine white fur. A small, simple smile curves its pink nose, giving it an endearing, cheerful demeanor. The rabbit wears a green safari-style hat adorned with a circular gold emblem on the front. Its uniform consists of olive-green field gear — a short-sleeved shirt with buttoned pockets, matching shorts, and a brown belt with a metallic buckle — all rendered with subtle fabric texture. Over its shoulders rests a green backpack with tan straps and a small front pocket, secured with a buckle; brown hiking boots complete the ensemble. The background is a clean, minimalist white gradient, emphasizing the character’s vibrant colors: greens, browns, and soft whites. Lighting casts gentle shadows beneath the feet and along the contours of the outfit, enhancing depth without harshness. The overall style is whimsical yet detailed, with rounded edges and soft highlights suggesting a digital sculpted character designed for visual appeal and playfulness.\n\n{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><h2></h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load CLIP</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic_int8.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download qwen3-vl-4b-heretic_int8<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">4.5 GB</span></a></span>&nbsp;\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders<br><br><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-vp\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/tree/main\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">M